# Nullable indexed array stores are rejected

Verifies an indexed assignment applies the same non-nullable storage gate as
an array literal.

>>> source
let item: int? = 10
let values: int[] = [1]
values[0] = item

<<< stdout

<<< stderr
eck: nullable value must be narrowed before this operation at Span { start: 56, end: 60 }

<<< exit
1
